It is the result of a major volcanic eruption that lasted more than three million years.

01:22:14.932 --> 01:22:21.836
The immense layer of lava underwent successive collapses that eventually created an underground void.

01:22:32.561 --> 01:22:34.502
This is how the spectacular vault,

01:22:34.602 --> 01:22:35.803
