She may discover how these mysterious extremophiles have colonized the underground lake,

01:26:43.989 --> 01:26:48.592
and how they manage to live in an environment where no other living thing can.

01:26:49.853 --> 01:26:55.595
What is fascinating is that volcanoes allow to provide the elements that were necessary for the creation of life.

01:26:56.516 --> 01:26:56.776
Finally,

01:26:56.777 --> 01:27:00.097
the current volcanoes are always sorts of small bubbles,

01:27:00.098 --> 01:27:08.561
vents that will allow the development of a life thriving within ecosystems of extremely rich microorganisms.

01:27:11.593 --> 01:27:12.754
In recent decades,

01:27:13.034 --> 01:27:20.079
science has made great strides in understanding the complex mechanisms that make our planet hospitable to life.

01:27:22.341 --> 01:27:24.162
Thanks to the research undertaken,

01:27:24.562 --> 01:27:27.164
cross-referencing the knowledge of many disciplines,

01:27:27.444 --> 01:27:30.606
we have discovered that the forces at work on the Earth,

01:27:30.786 --> 01:27:33.768
as well as in the sky and in the hearts of oceans,

01:27:34.209 --> 01:27:39.072
react with each other and form chains of events that we could not have imagined.

01:27:41.217 --> 01:27:44.480
We now know that our planet is a robust organism,

01:27:44.920 --> 01:27:50.284
endowed with regulatory systems that allow it to survive severe environmental changes.

01:27:51.825 --> 01:27:52.966
We also know that,

01:27:53.226 --> 01:27:54.948
like any living organisms,

01:27:55.188 --> 01:27:56.149
it has limits,

01:27:56.329 --> 01:27:56.549
which,

01:27:56.749 --> 01:27:57.510
if crossed,

01:27:57.790 --> 01:28:00.072
would endanger the very life it shelters.

01:28:02.474 --> 01:28:06.176
These scientific advances provide us with a lesson in humility.

01:28:07.189 --> 01:28:14.111
They question our place in a world whose story is unfolding on a timescale much broader than our own.

01:28:14.951 --> 01:28:24.494
A world in which man's survival will depend on his ability to understand and adapt to the extraordinary effervescence of the Earth.

